 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's main goods traded with Portugal in 2025 include machinery and mechanical appliances, tobacco products, and pharmaceutical products for exports, and beverages, spirits and vinegar, fish and crustaceans, and coffee and tea for imports.",
  "Total exports to Portugal amount to 80.7 million euros, while imports reach 96.9 million euros, making total trade 177.7 million euros.",
  "The largest export category is machinery and mechanical appliances at 11.8 million euros, representing 14.7% of exports, whereas the largest import category is beverages, spirits and vinegar at 16.8 million euros, or 17.3% of imports.",
  "The top three export categories make up 33.5% of exports, while the top three import categories account for 29.7% of imports, showing a diverse trade portfolio.",
  "The data are presented in current euros and are not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
 ],
